.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH taur-import 1  "taur-import " 
.SH NAME
taur\-import \- Import a package directory containing .SRCINFO (and PKGBUILD)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtaur import\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-maintainer\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import a package directory containing .SRCINFO (and PKGBUILD)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<HOME>\fR
Data directory (default: ~/.local/share/taur)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBTAUR_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-maintainer\fR \fI<MAINTAINER>\fR
Existing user to set as maintainer (orphan if omitted)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<DB>\fR
SQLite database path (default: <home>/taur.db)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBTAUR_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Package registry. Omit for the exempt `local` registry
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>

.SH ENVIRONMENT
Command\-line flags take precedence over environment variables, which take precedence over defaults.
.TP
\fBTAUR_HOME\fR
Data directory (git repos, outbox, SSH host key; default database). Default: ~/.local/share/taur.
.TP
\fBTAUR_DB\fR
SQLite database file. WAL and SHM sidecars are created beside it. The parent directory must already exist. Default: <home>/taur.db.
